
### 查詢所有公司
GET http://localhost:8080/api/companies

### 查單筆公司
GET http://localhost:8080/api/companies/12


### ==================== APPROVE ====================
### 新增公司
POST http://localhost:8080/api/companies
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "第九測試企業股份有限公司",
  "taxId": "20235000"
}



### 新增授信申請
POST http://localhost:8080/api/credit-applications
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "companyId": 17,
  "requestedAmount": 6000000,
  "purpose": "營運週轉"
}

### 送出授信申請
POST http://localhost:8080/api/credit-applications/4/submit


### 核准授信申請
POST http://localhost:8080/api/credit-applications/4/approve
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "approvedAmount": 6000000,
  "comment": "Approved after credit review"
}

### ==================== REJECT ====================

### 新增授信申請（Reject 測試）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/credit-applications
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "companyId": 13,
  "requestedAmount": 5000000,
  "purpose": "設備採購"
}

### 送出授信申請（Reject 測試）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/credit-applications/6/submit

### 駁回授信申請
POST http://localhost:8080/api/credit-applications/6/reject
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "comment": "Insufficient repayment capacity"
}
